## Model card (duplicate folder — resolved to canonical dot spelling)

- **Name:** Gemma 4 12B Unified (both folders).
- **Canonical folder:** `../gemma-4.12b-unified/` — id **`google/gemma-4-12B`**, HF `google/gemma-4-12B`, full curated meta (GPQA 78.8%, LiveCodeBench v6 72%, 16 GB VRAM, Apache 2.0). **Report 108** (Overall 77) lives there.
- **This (excluded) folder:** `gemma-4-12b-unified` — id **`opencode/gemma-4-12b-unified`**, a **9-line stub** with **no benchmark rows**, no HF link, no `standout`/`tradeoff`, no pricing tiers. Same name, same 12B unified/encoder-free multimodal description, same 262K context, same "Text, image, audio in; text out" modalities, same "free open weights."
- **Provider / access:** Google DeepMind; open weights (Apache 2.0), self-host or hosted (~$0.10/$0.25–0.30 per 1M).
- **Modalities:** text, image, audio in → text out (encoder-free unified cross-modal projection).
- **Architecture:** ~11.95B dense open-weight multimodal model, runs in ~16 GB VRAM.

